<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Smith Barney ups Energen.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Smith Barney ups Energen.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney raised Energen Corp to buy from neutral, a Smith Barney source said.  </p>
<p>-- No further details were immediately available.</p>
